        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions AP-CST2RDDSBR, Elegant Castle Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Elegant Split Reed Appliance Pull is fancy enough for even the most luxurious of homes. It is available in 20 inch, 24 inch, and 30 inch lengths in a wide variety of finishes including satin brass, which has been all the rage in home decorating lately. All 3 sizes have a 1 inch diameter for a sturdy pull that can stand up to the high vacuum seals of freezers and refrigerators. Each pull is ready to install on a 3/4 inch thick appliance panel, so add some lavishness to your kitchen with this Ornate Appliance Handle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/elegant-split-reed-style-door-pull-first-impressions-cst2rddsbrrr\"><b>Split Reed Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions AP-CST2RDDSBR Appliance Handle:\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-simplex-902-size.gif?v=1704354717\" width=\"100\" height=\"72\" border=\"0\" align =\"right\" alt=\"Made in the USA\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/cf833-1-detail-picture.jpg?v=1704354637\" target=\"new\"><b>FII-AP-CST2 Detailed Picture</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-AP-CST02-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262221\"><b>First Impressions AP-CST2RDDSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes</b>\r\n<ul> \r\n<b>AP-CST2020RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 13-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-CST2024RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 17-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>AP-CST2030RDDSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 23-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually.</i>\r\n</p>",
